  m_text: 'Centuries ago, I worked as an overnight stocker at Glorpmart, the biggest
    grocery store chain in the galaxy. I got crushed by a pallet of eggs that was
    dropped on me by a careless coworker. He was not forklift-certified.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
